  "notes": "A compound verb: ⟦{投|な}げる→投げる：01135_nageru⟧ (to throw) + ⟦{込|こ}む→込む：00719_komu⟧ (into). The ⟦{込|こ}む→込む：00719_komu⟧ element adds the directional meaning of entering a space.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧Y⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{投|な}げ{込|こ}む (throw X into Y)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{投|な}げ{込|こ}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ can mean either 'is in the act of throwing in' or 'has thrown in (and it's still there).'\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦ゴミ→ゴミ：00840_gomi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{箱|はこ}→箱：02162_hako⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{投|な}げ{込|こ}む (to toss garbage into the bin)\n- ⟦{手紙|てがみ}→手紙：00675_tegami⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦ポスト→ポスト：02965_posuto⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{投|な}げ{込|こ}む (to drop a letter in the mailbox)\n- ⟦{石|いし}→石：02177_ishi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{池|いけ}→池：00848_ike⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{投|な}げ{込|こ}む (to throw stones into a pond)\n\nRELATED 〜{込|こ}む VERBS:\n- ⟦{飛|と}び{込|こ}む→飛び込む：04614_tobikomu⟧ (to jump into)\n- ⟦{駆|か}け{込|こ}む→駆け込む：06112_kakekomu⟧ (to rush into)\n- ⟦{迷|まよ}い{込|こ}む→迷い込む：17603_mayoikomu⟧ (to wander into)",
